<div class="widget widget--one-col-text">
    <div class="widget__wrapper">
		<div class="w-one-col-text">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-xs-12">
                    <div class="editable-text">
<h2>For students, teachers and anybody after quick facts</h2><p>The latest data and information covering a wide range of topic areas (Filter by topic) and type of resource (Filter by resource type) with descriptions about each resource, date of release and a link to the main report for further research.</p><h3>Key curriculum areas</h3><p>Key curriculum areas covered include: health, burden of disease, chronic disease, housing, population groups, social determinants, behavioural risk factors – alcohol, nutrition, illicit drug use, physical activity, smoking, weight and biomedical risk factors – blood pressure, cholesterol, and blood sugar levels.</p>                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

    




					


























